    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/729fb0fa4dd7692e73aa654c480985e7.avif?t=1739325545\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Choose your charge to be positive or negative, aim, and launch at an adequate speed to reach the target. In order to win, the key is remember: &quot;like charges repel, opposite charges attract&quot;.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/701e525a36f6d83470fce85fac784862.poster.avif?t=1739325545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/701e525a36f6d83470fce85fac784862.webm?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/701e525a36f6d83470fce85fac784862.mp4?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- All kind of peculiar effects when a charge moves close to others.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/ecf6bb101b52d3a189ac25aece7f26dd.poster.avif?t=1739325545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/ecf6bb101b52d3a189ac25aece7f26dd.webm?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/ecf6bb101b52d3a189ac25aece7f26dd.mp4?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Use your wits. This game will make you think.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/83166ae3b14174dfe27c0835e42628e5.poster.avif?t=1739325545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/83166ae3b14174dfe27c0835e42628e5.webm?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/83166ae3b14174dfe27c0835e42628e5.mp4?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/729fb0fa4dd7692e73aa654c480985e7.avif?t=1739325545\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Choose your charge to be positive or negative, aim, and launch at an adequate speed to reach the target. In order to win, the key is remember: &quot;like charges repel, opposite charges attract&quot;.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/701e525a36f6d83470fce85fac784862.poster.avif?t=1739325545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/701e525a36f6d83470fce85fac784862.webm?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/701e525a36f6d83470fce85fac784862.mp4?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- All kind of peculiar effects when a charge moves close to others.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/ecf6bb101b52d3a189ac25aece7f26dd.poster.avif?t=1739325545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/ecf6bb101b52d3a189ac25aece7f26dd.webm?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/ecf6bb101b52d3a189ac25aece7f26dd.mp4?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Use your wits. This game will make you think.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/83166ae3b14174dfe27c0835e42628e5.poster.avif?t=1739325545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/83166ae3b14174dfe27c0835e42628e5.webm?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412760/extras/83166ae3b14174dfe27c0835e42628e5.mp4?t=1739325545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
